{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChPK7U3cESjhXPJWX2egD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`ard init` now uses a lock-driven upgrade planner instead of the conflict/`--force` logic. `go test ./...` passes. I did not run a separate linter, only `gofmt` on the files I changed.\n\nThe planner follows the issue's rules. `.ard/ard-init.lock` stores the ard version and the sha256 of each starter file written.\n\n- **Per file:** absent files are created. Files identical to the starter are unchanged. A file whose hash equals its lock entry is updated. Anything else is edited, never touched, and a diff against the starter is printed.\n- **No lock, or no entry:** the file counts as edited.\n- **Context docs:** create-if-absent only.\n- **Dropped files:** lock entries no longer in the starter are listed and never deleted.\n- **Lock parsing:** a hand-edited or garbage lock never fails the run. Bad YAML or bad entries are ignored with a warning, so those files count as edited.\n- **Lock writes:** the lock is written with every created or updated file, and only when something is written, so \"nothing to propose\" still works.\n- **Gate and protection:** `.ard/ard-init.lock` is accepted by `CheckInitPath` and added to the starter's `merge.protected_paths`.\n- **Tests:** a new `plan_test.go` covers every planner case, context docs, dropped files, a hand-edited lock and the marshal round trip. A harness test covers first run, rerun, and edited, stale and dropped files together.\n- **Docs:** I updated the getting-started, configuration and operations pages.\n\nThings to know:\n- **`--force` is removed.** This breaks any script that passes it. `InitOpts.Force` is replaced by `InitOpts.Version`, which carries the ard version into the lock.\n- **This repo's `.ard/config.yaml` is untouched.** A maintainer must add the lock to its `merge.protected_paths` by hand if they want it protected here.\n- **Unchanged files get no lock entry.** A repo that already matches the starter gets no entries until a file is created or updated.\n\nThe report is at `.ard/344/worker-engineer.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":889,"cache_read_input_tokens":61014,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":889},"output_tokens":698,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b9fc659e-2b79-4850-b189-0bda8f59ffda","uuid":"eb2e4d75-fd4d-4a65-9dae-93fe22f99653","timestamp":"2026-11-25T08:14:59.954Z","request_id":"req_011ChPK7TtvRUemeSbmH1ymo"}
